        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Koga\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/48/2058_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Koga:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The only thing that can remove the cards from beneath Savage Mana is the power itself or if Savage Mana is destroyed and the answer to the second question is B, only the first target takes the extra damage from Haka of Battle.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Agreed.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And don't feel too bad about beating Apostate that badly. Savage Mana can do that to villains, but you don't always have Savage Mana available to you.</p>",
